 "_why_texts": "texts: built props that carry readable text (centre, size w/h in m, rotY deg; opt = only when that option is set, unless = not when that option is false). The guard refuses a frame that cuts one of them by the edge (pilot 1/2: a half sign reads as a fault). no_lens: boxes the camera may never be inside (min, max), e.g. under the sand or the hall floor. blank = not readable (so not guarded) when that text option is ''.",
